                      "name": "**requests**",
                      "type": " [ImguiMultiSelectIO](imguiMultiSelectIOType) | [SelectionRequest](imgui#selectionrequest)[] ",
                      "desc": "[ImguiMultiSelectIO](imguiMultiSelectIOType) 或 [SelectionRequest](imgui#selectionrequest) 的数组."
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**[ itemsCount ]** { [number](dataTypes#number) } - 总项数. ",
